  description: "A letter where it is written: \"You have been gone too long, too
    many days away from me. His memory is all I have left of us since you left with
    all these pilgrims. I know you\u2019re brave and strong, but I\u2019m not as
    strong as you, I need you. Please, go home.  -Your beloved [signature]\""
